ct manual examination, to make sure the line tidy and less-tangle, so as to avoid possible snap and line breaking; Larger spool inner diameter design makes feeding smoother. The Imported raw material upgrades with stronger toughness. It is not easy to break, meeting your demands for printing projects of functional parts with higher toughnes.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐃𝐈𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐀𝐂𝐂𝐔𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐘 &amp; 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐘 - Advanced CCD diameter measuring and self-adaptive control system in the manufacturing guarantee these PLA filaments of 1.75 mm diameter, dimensional accuracy + / - .02 mm; 1kg/spool.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 &amp;𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐄𝐍𝐕𝐈𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐀𝐋-𝐅𝐑𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐃𝐋𝐘 - Compatible with 99% FDM &amp; FFF 3D printers (with heated beds) 3D Pen. Environmental protection, made from starch raw materials derived from renewable plant resources.</span></li>\n</ul>","long_description":"<ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\">\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span class=\"a-list-item\">1KG NET Filament in Each Spool</span></strong></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><strong><span class=\"a-list-item\">Colour you can choose of your Choice</span></strong></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐂𝐎𝐒𝐓-𝐄𝐅𝐅𝐄𝐂𝐓𝐈𝐕𝐄 𝐕𝐀𝐋𝐔𝐄 𝐏𝐀𝐂𝐊 𝐄𝐕𝐄𝐑 - This 3D printer filament bundle 1.75mm is the most cost-effective filament  And you can just print whatever you want. Saving money but not inspirations!</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐂𝐋𝐎𝐆-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 &amp; 𝐁𝐔𝐁𝐁𝐋𝐄-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 - This 3D printer filament bundle adopts a special patented design and manufacturing process to ensure a smooth and stable printing experience for these PLA filaments. It is completely dried for 24 hours before packaging and vacuum-sealed in a PC bag with a desiccant. (Note: Appropriate temperature range and machine operation required.)</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐋𝐄𝐒𝐒-𝐓𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐋𝐄 &amp; 𝐒𝐓𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐆𝐄𝐑 𝐓𝐎𝐔𝐆𝐇𝐍𝐄𝐒𝐒 - Full mechanical winding and strict manual examination, to make sure the line tidy and less-tangle, so as to avoid possible snap and line breaking; Larger spool inner diameter design makes feeding smoother. The Imported raw material upgrades with stronger toughness. It is not easy to break, meeting your demands for printing projects of functional parts with higher toughnes.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐃𝐈𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐀𝐂𝐂𝐔𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐘 &amp; 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐘 - Advanced CCD diameter measuring and self-adaptive control system in the manufacturing guarantee these PLA filaments of 1.75 mm diameter, dimensional accuracy + / - .02 mm; 1kg/spool.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 &amp;𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐄𝐍𝐕𝐈𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐀𝐋-𝐅𝐑𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐃𝐋𝐘 - Compatible with 99% FDM &amp; FFF 3D printers (with heated beds) 3D Pen. Environmental protection, made from starch raw materials derived from renewable plant resources.</span></li>\n</ul>","images":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009319-788195334.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009268-167881988.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444008189-303818871.png"],"variants":[],"options":[{"id":"Style","name":"Pack","variantName":"pack1","displayName":"Pack","displayType":"bundle-builder","selectionMode":"bundle","required":true,"active":true,"bundleTiers":[{"id":"t-1","name":"Buy 1","count":1,"priceType":"fixed","priceValue":2000,"weightUnit":"kg","weightValue":1},{"id":"t-3","name":"Buy 3","count":3,"badgeText":"Best Offer","isPopular":true,"priceType":"per_variant","priceValue":300,"weightUnit":"kg","savingsText":"","weightValue":5}],"sortOrder":0,"values":[{"value":"red","displayValue":"red","sort